## 36. What are React Portals?

React Portals allow a component to render its DOM output into a different DOM node outside its normal parent DOM hierarchy.

Example:

```jsx
createPortal(
  <Modal />,
  document.getElementById("modal-root")
);
```

Conceptually:

```text
React Tree

App
 └── Dashboard
      └── Modal


DOM

body
 ├── #root
 │    └── App
 │
 └── #modal-root
      └── Modal
